  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Season the lamb shoulder with salt and black pepper.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a large oven-safe skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Sear the lamb shoulder until browned on all sides, then transfer to the oven and cook for 20 minutes.",
    "Let the lamb rest for 5 minutes before slicing into thin strips.",
    "Spread a quarter cup of hummus on each ssam wrap.",
    "Top the hummus with a few slices of lamb, some mixed greens, cherry tomatoes, and red onion.",
    "Sprinkle with chopped parsley and a squeeze of lemon juice.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
